OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Palestrina
OL,5,     GPalestrina is employed by popes
OL,6,     Gand princes, with his fame
OL,7,     Gspreading beyond Rome: Donald
OL,8,     GMacleod sees how he is now
OL,9,     Gworking on the reformation of
OL,10,     Gmusic after the Council of Trent.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GPetroc Trelawny visits the Cutty
OL,13,     GSark to hear about an immersive
OL,14,     Gproduction of Purcell's Dido and
OL,15,     GAeneas, and violinist Daniel
OL,16,     GPioro and harpsichordist David
OL,17,     GGordon perform live.
